FS Platform Model Handover V1.0.3a\par
\par
1. Key changes\par
- Split static clearance and dynamic clearance\par
- Rules layer uses static clearance only\par
- Targets layer uses dynamic clearance only\par
- Effective travel is now used in rule checks\par
- Range mode keeps results.inputs as preprocessed primary scenario and adds inputsRaw / inputsNominal\par
- validation.warnings are emitted via warning(...) when warnOnDeprecatedInput=true\par
- run_batch summary adds static/dynamic clearance and effective travel fields\par
\par
2. Core semantics\par
- deltaSuspWheel = Fmain ./ kw\par
- deltaTire = Fmain ./ kt\par
- deltaGround = deltaSuspWheel + deltaTire\par
- shockStroke = mr .* deltaSuspWheel\par
\par
3. Clearance outputs\par
- results.clearance.hStaticAll / hStaticMin / hStaticMinName\par
- results.clearance.hDynamicAll / hDynamicMin / hDynamicMinName\par
- hAll / hMin / hMinName remain as dynamic aliases\par
\par
4. Effective travel\par
- effectiveJounce = min(jounceMax, wheelJounceFromShock)\par
- effectiveDroop = min(droopMax, wheelDroopFromShock)\par
- effectiveTotalTravel = effectiveJounce + effectiveDroop\par
\par
5. Verification on 2026-03-20\par
- New V1.0.3a tests all passed\par
- MATLAB must be run outside sandbox because sandbox startup reports File system inconsistency\par
